      "evidence": [
        {"source": "netlist", "quote": "(comp (ref \"C1\") (value \"0.1uF/16V\")"},
        {"source": "spec", "quote": "C2 default: 1 µF/25 V | C1/C5/C7/C8/C9/C10 = 1 µF/25 V | Matches default"}
      ],
      "impact": "The Display_Power_Switch node has less capacitance than intended, changing the EPD power-rail decoupling/transient behavior relative to the reference design.",
      "confidence": 0.72
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The strongest anomaly is R2 being 10 Ω instead of the specified 10 kΩ, which would severely stress the Q2 gate-drive path. The EPD driver also shows a clear C1 value/rating mismatch against the specification."
